ch filters.md\"}","status":200,"type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"source\":{\"kind\":\"local\",\"path\":\"/work/trailhead-notes/Search filters.md\"},\"path\":\"/work/trailhead-notes/Search filters.md\",\"size\":635,\"identity\":\"worktree:/work/trailhead-notes:current:Search filters.md:981766dc43c3f1666be409a1da522e2c21b3b7df114beab81ebaf1a21f7fc2b5\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"# Search filters\\n\\nTrail search should say why a trail is hidden. Today the list shrinks, and\\nnobody can tell which filter did it.\\n\\n## What changes\\n\\n- The search bar shows each active filter as a chip.\\n- A chip removes its filter. See [[Filter chips]].\\n- Screen readers hear the change: the list is `aria-live=\\\"polite\\\"`.\\n\\n## From query to chips\\n\\n```mermaid\\nflowchart LR\\n  Q[Query text] --> P[parseQuery] --> C[Chips]\\n```\\n\\n| Filter     | Example               |\\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\\n| Region     | `region:alps`         |\\n| Difficulty | `difficulty:moderate` |\\n\\nRelated: [[Trail data]] and [[Accessibility checklist]].\\n\",\"plain\":false,\"vault\":{\"id\":\"vault_55d89bd1a58b3179d5185834\",\"path\":\"Search filters.md\"}}"},{"method":"POST","url":"/api/service/status","body":"{}","status":200,"type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","text":"{\"service\":\"med\",\"version\":1,\"pid\":13233,\"home\":\"/work/home\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"vault_55d89bd1a58b3179d5185834\",\"kind\":\"vault\",\"path\":\"/work/trailhead-notes\",\"identity\":\"191342060:1794706590106.82\",\"name\":\"trailhead-notes\",\"index\":{\"state\":\"ready\",\"revision\":2,\"result\":{\"files\":4,\"notes\":4,\"failedNotes\":0,\"links\":6,\"embeds\":0,\"unresolved\":0,\"ambiguous\":0,\"parsed\":0,\"readBytes\":0,\"changed\":0,\"removed\":0,\"failures\":0,\"resolvedLinks\":0,\"timings\":{\"enumerateMs\":0.7082920000000286,\"readMs\":0,\"parseMs\":0,\"updateMs\":0.08920799999998508,\"resolveAndCommitMs\":1.570333000000005,\"totalMs\":2.370042000000012}